t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The October <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/06/jobs-report-october-2026.html\">jobs report</a> crushed expectations, confirming that President Trump’s America First agenda is delivering a manufacturing renaissance.</strong> Tariffs and tax cuts are bringing production home, strengthening supply chains, raising blue-collar wages, and adding hundreds of thousands of jobs for American workers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Here’s what you need to know:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>165,000 jobs were added in October — blowing out expectations by over 100,000.<ul><li>19,000 manufacturing jobs were added — the strongest monthly gain since 2023.</li></ul>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>More than 100,000 manufacturing jobs and 120,000 factory construction jobs have been added since President Trump returned to office.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manufacturing employment is rising for the first time in three years, reversing the Biden-era loss of more than 200,000 factory jobs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>September’s jobs report was revised up to 60,000 jobs (double the initial estimates); August’s report was revised up to 186,000 jobs.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Wage growth reached its highest for the year, average hourly earnings beat expectations, and the unemployment rate fell.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Since day one, the Trump Administration has delivered on its promise to fight for American workers</strong>:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>More than 1.25 million private sector jobs have been <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/made-in-america-manufacturing-private-hiring-power-explosive-august-jobs-report/\">added</a> since President Trump returned to office.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Jobless claims <a href=\"https://www.breitbart.com/economy/2026/11/05/jobless-claims-fall-to-57-year-low-of-189000/\">fell</a> to a new 57-year low.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The trade deficit <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/economy/trade/u-s-trade-deficit-contracted-in-september-e9eeff46\">dropped</a> over 12% in September; U.S. goods exports hit a record high, up nearly 15% year-over-year.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Capital goods imports — the machinery and equipment needed to rebuild domestic industry — <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/business/us-trade-deficit-narrows-slightly-september-imports-race-record-high-2026-11-04/\">reached</a> a record 46% share of total imports.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>36% of equipment manufacturers have <a href=\"https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/reshoring-foreign-direct-investment-247k-jobs-2025-report-reshoring-initiative/873433/\">reshored or are reshoring</a>, and 63% are <a href=\"https://reshorenow.org/content/pdf/2026_Reshoring_Survey_Report.pdf?_sp=fce11f61-9c9b-4988-af9c-301a155a88eb.1793800878309\">making</a> capital investments to expand U.S. production.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>U.S. manufacturing <a href=\"https://www.ismworld.org/supply-management-news-and-reports/reports/ism-pmi-reports/pmi/october/\">expanded</a> for a 10<sup>th</sup> straight month.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Core capital goods orders are <a href=\"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/NEWORDER\">up</a> almost 14% from a year ago and are on track for a record share this year.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The economy <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/president-trump-unleashes-the-american-economy-gdp-surges-as-investment-hits-multi-year-high/\">grew</a> 3.4% in the third quarter, once again defying the experts.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trump-was-right-tariffs-and-tax-cuts-are-reshoring-manufacturing-creating-jobs/\">President Trump Was Right: Tariffs and Tax Cuts Are Reshoring Manufacturing, Creating Jobs</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
